    "description": "Engineered for the most demanding riders, the Blackbird V3 is the evolution of the iconic Blackbird V2, designed to deliver an unparalleled riding experience. Every element, from the hull to the outline, has been meticulously refined to maximize performance.\nIts visionary design pushes the boundaries of aerodynamics once more. The hull has been reworked with a deep double concave, offering exceptional forgiveness on touchdowns while increasing stability. This adjustment allows for riding narrower boards, and the slightly sharper rails generated by the double concave enhance the board's tracking ability when paddling. The outline has also been refined to meet the demands of the most discerning riders.\nWith its ultra-narrow width, it's ideal for speed enthusiasts, offering quick take-offs in downwind conditions.\nWe've expanded the range with new sizes to cater to the needs of intermediate and expert downwind riders. These new sizes have also led to an evolution of the shape to adapt to the most performant foils on the market, particularly for downwind and light wind wingfoiling. The Blackbird V3's long box also allows for a perfect fit with all types of foils on the market.\nWith its full carbon construction and strategically placed reinforcements, the Blackbird V3 offers an exceptional weight-to-stiffness ratio. You'll feel every nuance of the water beneath your feet, enabling precise maneuvers and unmatched speeds, whether you're competing, downwinding, or light wind wingfoiling. The Blackbird V3 is truly a must-have for passionate riders. Don't wait, the Blackbird V3 is ready to transform every session into an unforgettable adventure.",
    "category": "Good deals > End of line",
    "countryOfOrigin": "FR",
